<P>((śrī))
<P>((śrīmatē rāmānujāya nama))

<P>((nammāḻvār tiruvāy malarntaruḷiya tiruvāymoḻi))


<A NAME="TVM_01"><H1>tiruvāy moḻi mutaṟ pattu.</H1></A>


<H2><A NAME="TVM_01_01">2791__((TVM_01.01))</A></H2>

<H3>$$2791</H3>
__&&2791__$$01.01.1##__AAM_2899_::_LFC_2675_!!_
<P>uyarvaṟa vuyarnalam muṭiyavaṉ yavaṉavaṉ
<BR>mayarvaṟa matinalam aruḷiṉaṉ yavaṉavaṉ
<BR>ayarvaṟum amararkaḷ atipati yavaṉavaṉ
<BR>tuyaraṟu cuṭaraṭi toḻuteḻeṉ maṉaṉē. (2)
<BR>$$1.1.1##


<H3>$$2792</H3>
__&&2792__$$01.01.2##__AAM_2900_::_LFC_2676_!!_
<P>maṉaṉaka malamaṟa malarmici yeḻutarum
<BR>maṉaṉuṇar vaḷavilaṉ, poṟiyuṇar vaviyilaṉ
<BR>iṉaṉuṇar, muḻunalam, etirnikaḻ kaḻiviṉum
<BR>iṉaṉilaṉ, ṉeṉaṉuyir, mikunari yilaṉē.
<BR>$$1.1.2##


<H3>$$2793</H3>
__&&2793__$$01.01.3##__AAM_2901_::_LFC_2677_!!_
<P>ilaṉatu vuṭiyaṉi teṉaniṉi variyavaṉ
<BR>nilaṉiṭi vicumpiṭi uruviṉaṉ aruviṉaṉ
<BR>pulaṉoṭu pulaṉalaṉ, oḻivilaṉ, paranta an
<BR>nalaṉuṭi yoruvaṉi naṇukiṉam nāmē.
<BR>$$1.1.3##


<H3>$$2794</H3>
__&&2794__$$01.01.4##__AAM_2902_::_LFC_2678_!!_
<P>nāmava ṉivaṉuvaṉ, avaḷivaḷuvaḷevaḷ
<BR>tāmavarivaruvar, atuvitu vutuvetu
<BR>vīmavi yiviyuvi, yavinalan tīṅkavi
<BR>āmavi yāyavi, yāyniṉṟa avarē.
<BR>$$1.1.4##


<H3>$$2795</H3>
__&&2795__$$01.01.5##__AAM_2903_::_LFC_2679_!!_
<P>avaravar tamatama taṟivaṟi vakivaki
<BR>avaravar riṟiyava reṉavaṭi yaṭivarkaḷ
<BR>avaravar riṟiyavar kuṟivila riṟiyavar
<BR>avaravar vitivaḻi yaṭiyaniṉ ṟaṉarē.
<BR>$$1.1.5##


<H3>$$2796</H3>
__&&2796__$$01.01.6##__AAM_2904_::_LFC_2680_!!_
<P>niṉṟaṉar riruntaṉar kiṭantaṉar tirintaṉar
<BR>niṉṟilar riruntilar kiṭantilar tirintilar
<BR>eṉṟumo riyalviṉar eṉaniṉi variyavar
<BR>eṉṟumo riyalvoṭu niṉṟaven tiṭarē.
<BR>$$1.1.6##


<H3>$$2797</H3>
__&&2797__$$01.01.7##__AAM_2905_::_LFC_2681_!!_
<P>tiṭavicum perivaḷi nīrnila mivimici
<BR>paṭarporuḷ muḻuvatu māyavi yavitoṟum
<BR>uṭalmici yuyireṉak karanteṅkum parantuḷaṉ
<BR>cuṭarmiku curutiyu ḷiviyaṇṭa curaṉē.
<BR>$$1.1.7##


<H3>$$2798</H3>
__&&2798__$$01.01.8##__AAM_2906_::_LFC_2682_!!_
<P>curaraṟi varunili viṇmutal muḻuvatum
<BR>varaṉmuta lāyavi muḻutuṇṭa paraparaṉ
<BR>puramoru mūṉṟerit tamararkku maṟiviyantu
<BR>araṉayaṉ eṉavula kaḻittamit tuḷaṉē.
<BR>$$1.1.8##


<H3>$$2799</H3>
__&&2799__$$01.01.9##__AAM_2907_::_LFC_2683_!!_
<P>uḷaṉeṉi luḷaṉava ṉuruvamiv vuruvukaḷ
<BR>uḷaṉala ṉeṉilavaṉ aruvamiv varuvukaḷ
<BR>uḷaṉeṉa vilaṉeṉa vivikuṇa muṭimiyil
<BR>uḷaṉiru takimiyo ṭoḻivilaṉ parantē.
<BR>$$1.1.9##


<H3>$$2800</H3>
__&&2800__$$01.01.10#__AAM_2908_::_LFC_2684_!!_
<P>parantataṇ paraviyuḷnīrtoṟum parantuḷaṉ
<BR>parantaa ṇ ṭamiteṉa nilavicum poḻivaṟa
<BR>karantaci liṭantoṟum iṭantikaḻ poruṭoṟum
<BR>karanteṅkum parantuḷa ṉiviyuṇṭa karaṉē.
<BR>$$1.1.10##


<H3>$$2801</H3>
__&&2801__$$01.01.11#__AAM_2909_::_LFC_2685_!!_
<P>karavicum perivaḷi nīrnila mivimici
<BR>varaṉavil tiṟalvali yaḷipoṟi yāyniṉṟa
<BR>paraṉaṭi mēlkuru kūrccaṭa kōpaṉcol
<BR>niraṉiṟi yāyirat tivipattum vīṭē. (2)
<BR>$$1.1.11##


<HR>

<H2><A NAME="TVM_01_02">2802__((TVM_01.02))</A></H2>

<H3>$$2802</H3>
__&&2802__$$01.02.1##__AAM_2910_::_LFC_2686_!!_
<P>vīṭumiṉ muṟṟavum--vīṭuceytu ummuyir
<BR>vīṭuṭi yāṉiṭi--vīṭuceymmiṉē. (2)
<BR>$$1.2.1##


<H3>$$2803</H3>
__&&2803__$$01.02.2##__AAM_2911_::_LFC_2687_!!_
<P>miṉṉiṉ niliyila--maṉṉuyi rākkikaḷ
<BR>eṉṉu miṭattu iṟi--uṉṉumiṉ nīrē.
<BR>$$1.2.2##


<H3>$$2804</H3>
__&&2804__$$01.02.3##__AAM_2912_::_LFC_2688_!!_
<P>nīrnuma teṉṟivi--vērmutal māyttu iṟi
<BR>cērmiṉ uyirkku ata--ṉērniṟi yillē.
<BR>$$1.2.3##


<H3>$$2805</H3>
__&&2805__$$01.02.4##__AAM_2913_::_LFC_2689_!!_
<P>illatu muḷḷatum--alla tavaṉuru
<BR>elliyi lannalam--pulkupaṟ ṟaṟṟē.
<BR>$$1.2.4##


<H3>$$2806</H3>
__&&2806__$$01.02.5##__AAM_2914_::_LFC_2690_!!_
<P>aṟṟatu paṟṟeṉil--uṟṟatu vīṭuuyir
<BR>ceṟṟatu maṉṉuṟil--aṟṟiṟi paṟṟē.
<BR>$$1.2.5##


<H3>$$2807</H3>
__&&2807__$$01.02.6##__AAM_2915_::_LFC_2691_!!_
<P>paṟṟila ṉīcaṉum--muṟṟavum niṉṟaṉaṉ
<BR>paṟṟili yāy avaṉ--muṟṟi laṭaṅkē.
<BR>$$1.2.6##


<H3>$$2808</H3>
__&&2808__$$01.02.7##__AAM_2916_::_LFC_2692_!!_
<P>aṭaṅkeḻil campattu--aṭaṅkakkaṇṭu īcaṉ
<BR>aṭaṅkeḻi laḵteṉṟu--aṭaṅkuka vuḷḷē.
<BR>$$1.2.7##


<H3>$$2809</H3>
__&&2809__$$01.02.8##__AAM_2917_::_LFC_2693_!!_
<P>uḷḷa muriceyal--uḷḷavim mūṉṟiyum
<BR>uḷḷik keṭuttu iṟi--yuḷḷilo ṭuṅkē.
<BR>$$1.2.8##


<H3>$$2810</H3>
__&&2810__$$01.02.9##__AAM_2918_::_LFC_2694_!!_
<P>oṭuṅka avaṉkaṇ--oṭuṅkalu mellām
<BR>viṭumpiṉṉu mākki--viṭumpoḻu teṇṇē.
<BR>$$1.2.9##


<H3>$$2811</H3>
__&&2811__$$01.02.10#__AAM_2919_::_LFC_2695_!!_
<P>eṇperuk kannalattu--oṇporu ḷīṟila
<BR>vaṇpukaḻ nāraṇaṉ--tiṇkaḻal cērē. (2)
<BR>$$1.2.10##


<H3>$$2812</H3>
__&&2812__$$01.02.11#__AAM_2920_::_LFC_2696_!!_
<P>cērttaṭat teṉkuru--kūrcṭa kōpaṉcol
<BR>cīrttoṭi yāyirattu--ōrttavip pattē. (2)
<BR>$$1.2.11##


<HR>

<H2><A NAME="TVM_01_03">2813__((TVM_01.03))</A></H2>

<H3>$$2813</H3>
__&&2813__$$01.03.1##__AAM_2921_::_LFC_2697_!!_
<P>pattuṭi yaṭiyavark keḷiyavaṉ, piṟarkaḷuk kariya
<BR>vittakaṉ malarmakaḷ virumpumnam arumpeṟa laṭikaḷ
<BR>mattuṟu kaṭiveṇṇey kaḷaviṉil u raviṭi yāppuṇṭu
<BR>ettiṟam uraliṉō ṭiṇintirun tēṅkiya eḷivē. (2)
<BR>$$1.3.1##


<H3>$$2814</H3>
__&&2814__$$01.03.2##__AAM_2922_::_LFC_2698_!!_
<P>eḷivaru miyalviṉaṉ nilivaram pilapala piṟappāy,
<BR>oḷivaru muḻunalam mutalila kēṭila vīṭām,
<BR>teḷitarum nilimiya toḻivilaṉ muḻuvatum, miṟiyōṉ,
<BR>aḷivaru maruḷiṉō ṭakattaṉaṉ, puṟattaṉa ṉamintē.
<BR>$$1.3.2##


<H3>$$2815</H3>
__&&2815__$$01.03.3##__AAM_2923_::_LFC_2699_!!_
<P>amivuṭi yaṟaneṟi muḻuvatu muyarvaṟa vuyarnta,
<BR>amivuṭi mutalkeṭal oṭiviṭi yaṟanila matuvām,
<BR>amivuṭi yamararum yāviyum yāvarum tāṉāma,f
<BR>amivuṭi nāraṇaṉ māyiyi yaṟipavar yārē?
<BR>$$1.3.3##


<H3>$$2816</H3>
__&&2816__$$01.03.4##__AAM_2924_::_LFC_2700_!!_
<P>yārumōr nilimiya ṉeṉavaṟi variya vemperumāṉ,
<BR>yārumōr nilimiya ṉeṉavaṟi veḷiyavem perumāṉ,
<BR>pērumō rāyiram piṟapala vuṭiyavem perumāṉ,
<BR>pērumō ruruvamu muḷatilli yilatilli piṇakkē.
<BR>$$1.3.4##


<H3>$$2817</H3>
__&&2817__$$01.03.5##__AAM_2925_::_LFC_2701_!!_
<P>piṇakkaṟa aṟuvakic camayamum neṟiyuḷḷi yuritta,
<BR>kaṇakkaṟu nalattaṉaṉ antami lātiyam pakavaṉ,
<BR>vaṇakkuṭit tavaneṟi vaḻiniṉṟu puṟaneṟi kaḷikaṭṭu,
<BR>uṇakkumiṉ paciyaṟa avaṉuṭi, yuṇarvukoṇ ṭuṇarntē.
<BR>$$1.3.5##


<H3>$$2818</H3>
__&&2818__$$01.03.6##__AAM_2926_::_LFC_2702_!!_
<P>uṇarntuṇarn tiḻintakaṉ ṟuyarnturu viyantavinnilimi,
<BR>uṇarntuṇarn tuṇarilum iṟiniliyuṇarvari tuyirkāḷ,
<BR>uṇarntuṇarn turitturit tariyaya ṉaraṉeṉṉumivari,
<BR>uṇarntuṇarn turitturit tiṟiñcumiṉ maṉappaṭṭatoṉṟē.
<BR>$$1.3.6##


<H3>$$2819</H3>
__&&2819__$$01.03.7##__AAM_2927_::_LFC_2703_!!_
<P>oṉṟeṉap palaveṉa aṟivarum vaṭiviṉuḷ niṉṟa,
<BR>naṉṟeḻil nāraṇaṉ nāṉmukaṉ araṉeṉṉu mivari,
<BR>oṉṟanum maṉattuvit tuḷḷinum irupaci yaṟuttu,
<BR>naṉṟeṉa nalañceyva tavaṉiṭi nammuṭi nāḷē.
<BR>$$1.3.7##


<H3>$$2820</H3>
__&&2820__$$01.03.8##__AAM_2928_::_LFC_2704_!!_
<P>nāḷu niṉ ṟaṭu namapaḻa miyaṅ koṭuviṉiyuṭaṉē
