<P>nāṭoṟum vīṭiṉṟiyē toḻakkūṭuṅkol naṉṉutalīr,
<BR>āṭuṟu tīṅkarumpum viḷicennelu mākiyeṅkum,
<BR>māṭuṟu pūntaṭañcēr vayalcūḻtaṇ tiruvallavāḻ,
<BR>nīṭuṟi kiṉṟapirāṉ nilantāviya nīḷkaḻalē?
<BR>$$5.9.8##


<H3>$$3329</H3>
__&&3329__$$05.09.9##__AAM_3437_::_LFC_3213_!!_
<P>kaḻalvaḷi pūrippayām kaṇṭukitoḻak kūṭuṅkolō,
<BR>kuḻaleṉṉa yāḻumeṉṉak kuḷircōliyuḷ tēṉarunti,
<BR>maḻali varivaṇṭukaḷ icipāṭum tiruvallavāḻ,
<BR>cuḻaliṉ malicakkarap perumāṉatu tollaruḷē?
<BR>$$5.9.9##


<H3>$$3330</H3>
__&&3330__$$05.09.10#__AAM_3438_::_LFC_3214_!!_
<P>tollaruḷ nalviṉiyāl collakkūṭuṅkol
<BR>tōḻimīrkāḷ,
<BR>tollaruḷ maṇṇumviṇṇum toḻaniṉṟa tirunakaram,
<BR>nallaru ḷāyiravar nalaṉēntum tiruvallavāḻ,
<BR>nallaruḷ namperumāṉ nārāyaṇaṉ nāmaṅkaḷē?
<BR>$$5.9.10##


<H3>$$3331</H3>
__&&3331__$$05.09.11#__AAM_3439_::_LFC_3215_!!_
<P>nāmaṅka ḷāyira muṭiyanamperu māṉaṭimēl,
<BR>cēmaṅkoḷ teṉkurukūrccaṭakōpaṉ terinturitta,
<BR>nāmaṅka ḷāyirattuḷ ivipattum tiruvallavāḻ,
<BR>cēmaṅkoḷ teṉṉakarmēl ceppuvārciṟan tārpiṟantē.
<BR>$$5.9.11##


<HR>

<H2><A NAME="TVM_05_10">3332__((TVM_05.10))</A></H2>

<H3>$$3332</H3>
__&&3332__$$05.10.1##__AAM_3440_::_LFC_3216_!!_
<P>piṟanta vāṟum vaḷarnta vāṟum
<BR>periya pāratam kiceytu, aivarkkut
<BR>tiṟaṅkaḷ cāṭṭi yiṭṭuc ceytu pōṉa māyaṅkaḷum,
<BR>niṟanta ṉūṭupuk keṉatāviyi niṉṟuniṉṟu
<BR>urukki yuṇkiṉṟa,ic
<BR>ciṟanta vāṉcuṭa rē.uṉṉi yeṉṟukol cērvatuvē.
<BR>$$5.10.1##


<H3>$$3333</H3>
__&&3333__$$05.10.2##__AAM_3441_::_LFC_3217_!!_
<P>vatuvi vārttiyuḷ ēṟu pāyntatum
<BR>māya māviṉi vāypi ḷantatum
<BR>matuvivār kuḻalār kuravi piṇinta kuḻakum,
<BR>atuvitu utuveṉṉa lāvaṉa valla
<BR>eṉṉiyuṉ ceyki nivikkum,
<BR>mutuviya mutalvā.uṉṉi yeṉṟu talip peyvaṉē?
<BR>$$5.10.2##


<H3>$$3334</H3>
__&&3334__$$05.10.3##__AAM_3442_::_LFC_3218_!!_
<P>peyyum pūṅkuḻal pēymuli yuṇṭa
<BR>piḷḷit tēṟṟamum, pērntōr cāṭiṟac
<BR>ceyya pātamoṉ ṟālceyta niṉciṟuc cēvakamum,
<BR>neyyuṇ vārttiyuḷ, aṉṉi kōlkoḷḷa
<BR>nīyuṉ tāmarik kaṇkaḷ nīrmalka,
<BR>piyavē niliyum vanteṉ ṉeñci yurukkuṅkaḷē.
<BR>$$5.10.3##


<H3>$$3335</H3>
__&&3335__$$05.10.4##__AAM_3443_::_LFC_3219_!!_
<P>kaḷḷa vēṭattik koṇṭupōyp puṟampukka
<BR>vāṟum, kalantacurari
<BR>uḷḷam pētamcey tiṭṭuyi ruṇṭa upāyaṅkaḷum,
<BR>veḷḷa nīrccaṭi yāṉum niṉṉiṭi vēṟalāmi
<BR>viḷaṅka niṉṟatum,
<BR>uḷḷamuḷ kuṭinteṉ uyiri yurukki yuṇṇumē.
<BR>$$5.10.4##


<H3>$$3336</H3>
__&&3336__$$05.10.5##__AAM_3444_::_LFC_3220_!!_
<P>uṇṇa vāṉavar kōṉuk kāyar
<BR>oruppa ṭutta aṭici luṇṭatum,
<BR>vaṇṇamāl variyi yeṭuttu maḻikāttatum,
<BR>maṇṇi muṉpaṭit tuṇṭu miḻntuka ṭanti ṭantu
<BR>maṇanta māyaṅkaḷ,
<BR>eṇṇun tōṟumeṉ ṉeñceri vāy
<BR>meḻu kokkuniṉṟē.
<BR>$$5.10.5##


<H3>$$3337</H3>
__&&3337__$$05.10.6##__AAM_3445_::_LFC_3221_!!_
<P>niṉṟa vāṟu mirunta vāṟum
<BR>kiṭanta vāṟum niṉippariyaṉa
<BR>oṉṟalā vuruvāy aruvāyaniṉ māyaṅkaḷ,
<BR>niṉṟu niṉṟu niṉikkiṉ ṟēṉuṉṉi
<BR>eṅṅa ṉamniṉi kiṟpaṉ, pāviyēṟku
<BR>oṉṟunaṉ kuriyāy ulaka muṇṭa oṇcuṭarē.
<BR>$$5.10.6##


<H3>$$3338</H3>
__&&3338__$$05.10.7##__AAM_3446_::_LFC_3222_!!_
<P>oṇcuṭarō ṭiruḷumāy niṉṟa vāṟum
<BR>uṇmiyō ṭiṉmiyāy vantu,eṉ
<BR>kaṇko ḷāvaki nīkaran teṉṉic ceykiṉṟaṉa,
<BR>eṇkoḷ cintiyuḷ nikiṉṟēṉeṉ kariya
<BR>māṇikka mē.eṉ kaṇkaṭkut
<BR>tiṇkoḷḷa vorunāḷ aruḷāyuṉ tiruvuruvē.
<BR>$$5.10.7##


<H3>$$3339</H3>
__&&3339__$$05.10.8##__AAM_3447_::_LFC_3223_!!_
<P>tiruvuruvu kiṭanta vāṟum koppūḻc
<BR>centā marimēl, ticimukaṉ
<BR>karuvuḷvīṟ ṟiruntu paṭittiṭṭa karumaṅkaḷum,
<BR>poruvi luntaṉi nāyakamavi kēṭkun
<BR>tōṟumeṉ ṉeñcam niṉṟu nekku,
<BR>aruvi cōrum kaṇṇī reṉceykēṉ aṭiyēṉē.
<BR>$$5.10.8##


<H3>$$3340</H3>
__&&3340__$$05.10.9##__AAM_3448_::_LFC_3224_!!_
<P>aṭiyi mūṉṟi yiranta vāṟum aṅkēniṉṟām
<BR>kaṭalum maṇṇum viṇṇum
<BR>muṭiya, īraṭiyāl muṭittuk koṇṭa mukkiyamum,
<BR>noṭiyu māṟavi kēṭkun tōṟumeṉ
<BR>neñcam niṉtaṉak kēka rintukum,
<BR>koṭiyaval viṉiyēṉ uṉṉi yeṉṟukol kūṭuvatē?
<BR>$$5.10.9##


<H3>$$3341</H3>
__&&3341__$$05.10.10#__AAM_3449_::_LFC_3225_!!_
<P>kūṭi nīri kaṭinta vāṟum
<BR>amutam tēvar uṇṇa, acurari
<BR>vīṭum vaṇṇaṅka ḷēceytu pōṉa vittakamum,
<BR>ūṭu pukkeṉa tāviyi yurukki
<BR>yuṇṭiṭu kiṉṟa, niṉtaṉṉi
<BR>nāṭum vaṇṇam collāy naccunā kaṇiyāṉē.
<BR>$$5.10.10##


<H3>$$3342</H3>
__&&3342__$$05.10.11#__AAM_3450_::_LFC_3226_!!_
<P>nākaṇimici nampirāṉ caraṇē
<BR>caraṇ namak keṉṟu, nāṭoṟum
<BR>ēka cintiya ṉāykkuru kūrccaṭa kōpaṉ māṟaṉ,
<BR>āka nūṟṟa an tāti yāyirattuḷ
<BR>iviyumōr pattum vallār,
<BR>māka vikuntattu makiḻveytuvar vikalumē.
<BR>$$5.10.11##

