<A NAME="TVM_06"><H1>tiruvāy moḻi āṟām pattu</H1></A>


<H2><A NAME="TVM_06_01">3343__((TVM_06.01))</A></H2>

<H3>$$3343</H3>
__&&3343__$$06.01.1##__AAM_3451_::_LFC_3227_!!_
<P>vikalpūṅ kaḻivāy vantu mēyum kurukiṉaṅkāḷ,
<BR>ceykoḷ cenne luyartiruvaṇvaṇ ṭūruṟiyum,
<BR>kikoḷ cakkarat teṉkaṉi vāyperu māṉikkaṇṭu,
<BR>kikaḷ kūppic collīr viṉiyāṭṭiyēṉ kātaṉmiyē.
<BR>$$6.1.1##


<H3>$$3344</H3>
__&&3344__$$06.01.2##__AAM_3452_::_LFC_3228_!!_
<P>kātal meṉpeṭi yōṭuṭaṉ mēyum karunārāy,
<BR>vēta vēḷvi yolimuḻaṅkum taṇ ṭiruvaṇvaṇṭūr,
<BR>nātaṉ ñālamel lāmuṇṭa namperu māṉikkaṇṭu,
<BR>pātam kitoḻutu paṇiyī raṭiyēṉ tiṟamē.
<BR>$$6.1.2##


<H3>$$3345</H3>
__&&3345__$$06.01.3##__AAM_3453_::_LFC_3229_!!_
<P>tiṟaṅka ḷākiyeṅ kumceykaḷūṭuḻal puḷḷiṉaṅkāḷ,
<BR>ciṟanta celvam malku tiruvaṇvaṇ ṭūruṟiyum,
<BR>kaṟaṅku cakkarak kikkaṉi vāypperu māṉikkaṇṭu,
<BR>iṟaṅki nīrtoḻutu paṇiyīraṭiyē ṉiṭarē.
<BR>$$6.1.3##


<H3>$$3346</H3>
__&&3346__$$06.01.4##__AAM_3454_::_LFC_3230_!!_
<P>iṭaril pōkam mūḻki yiṇintāṭum maṭavaṉṉaṅkāḷ,
<BR>viṭalil vēta volimuḻaṅkumtaṇ tiruvaṇvaṇṭūr,
<BR>kaṭalil mēṉip pirāṉkaṇ ṇaṇineṭu mālikkaṇṭu,
<BR>uṭalam nintorut tiyuru kum eṉ ṟuṇarttumiṉē.
<BR>$$6.1.4##


<H3>$$3347</H3>
__&&3347__$$06.01.5##__AAM_3455_::_LFC_3231_!!_
<P>uṇartta lūṭa luṇarntuṭaṉ mēyum maṭavaṉṉaṅkāḷ,
<BR>tiṇartta vaṇṭalkaḷ mēlcaṅku cērum tiruvaṇvaṇṭūr,
<BR>puṇartta pūntaṇ ṭuḻāymuṭi namperu māṉikkaṇṭu,
<BR>puṇartta kiyiṉarā yaṭiyēṉukkum pōṟṟumiṉē.
<BR>$$6.1.5##


<H3>$$3348</H3>
__&&3348__$$06.01.6##__AAM_3456_::_LFC_3232_!!_
<P>pōṟṟiyāṉ iran tēṉpuṉṉi mēluṟi pūṅkuyilkāḷ,
<BR>cēṟṟil vāḷi tuḷḷum tiruvaṇvaṇ ṭūruṟiyum,
<BR>āṟṟa lāḻiyaṅ kiyama rarperu māṉikkaṇṭu,
<BR>māṟṟaṅ koṇṭaru ḷīrmiyal tīrva toruvaṇṇamē.
<BR>$$6.1.6##


<H3>$$3349</H3>
__&&3349__$$06.01.7##__AAM_3457_::_LFC_3233_!!_
<P>oruvaṇ ṇamceṉṟu pukkeṉakku
<BR>oṉṟuri yoṇkiḷiyē,
<BR>ceruvoṇ pūmpoḻil cūḻcekkar
<BR>vēli tiruvaṇvaṇṭūr,
<BR>karuvaṇṇam ceyyavāy ceyyakaṇ
<BR>ceyyaki ceyyakāl,
<BR>ceruvoṇ cakkaram caṅkaṭi
<BR>yāḷam tiruntak kaṇṭē.
<BR>$$6.1.7##


<H3>$$3350</H3>
__&&3350__$$06.01.8##__AAM_3458_::_LFC_3234_!!_
<P>tiruntak kaṇṭeṉak koṉṟuri
<BR>yāyoṇ ciṟupūvāy.
<BR>cerunti ñāḻal makiḻpuṉṉi
<BR>cūḻtaṇ ṭiruvaṇvaṇṭūr,
<BR>peruntaṇ tāmarik kaṇperu
<BR>nīṇmuṭi nāḷtaṭantōḷ,
<BR>karuntiṇ māmukil pōltiru
<BR>mēṉi yaṭikaḷiyē.
<BR>$$6.1.8##


<H3>$$3351</H3>
__&&3351__$$06.01.9##__AAM_3459_::_LFC_3235_!!_
<P>aṭikaḷ kitoḻu talarmēl
<BR>aciyum aṉṉaṅkāḷ,
<BR>viṭivi caṅkolik kumtiru
<BR>vaṇvaṇ ṭūruṟiyum,
<BR>kaṭiya māyaṉtaṉ ṉikkaṇṇaṉi
<BR>neṭu mālikkaṇṭu,
<BR>koṭiya valviṉi yēṉtiṟam
<BR>kūṟumiṉ vēṟukoṇṭē.
<BR>$$6.1.9##


<H3>$$3352</H3>
__&&3352__$$06.01.10#__AAM_3460_::_LFC_3236_!!_
<P>vēṟu koṇṭummi yāṉiran
<BR>tēṉveṟi vaṇṭiṉaṅkāḷ,
<BR>tēṟu nīrppam pivaṭa
<BR>pālit tiruvaṇvaṇṭūr,
<BR>māṟil pōrarak kaṉmatiḷ
<BR>nīṟeḻac ceṟṟukanta,
<BR>ēṟucēvaka ṉārkkeṉṉi
<BR>yumuḷaḷ eṉmiṉkaḷē.
<BR>$$6.1.10##


<H3>$$3353</H3>
__&&3353__$$06.01.11#__AAM_3461_::_LFC_3237_!!_
<P>miṉkoḷ cērpuri nūlkuṟa
<BR>ḷāyakal ñālamkoṇṭa,
<BR>vaṉkaḷ vaṉaṭi mēlkuru
<BR>kūrccaṭa kōpaṉcoṉṉa,
<BR>paṇkoḷ āyirat tuḷḷivi
<BR>pattum tiruvaṇvaṇṭūrkku,
<BR>iṉkoḷ pāṭal vallār
<BR>mataṉarmiṉ ṉiṭiyavarkkē.
<BR>$$6.1.11##


<HR>

<H2><A NAME="TVM_06_02">3354__((TVM_06.02))</A></H2>

<H3>$$3354</H3>
__&&3354__$$06.02.1##__AAM_3462_::_LFC_3238_!!_
<P>miṉṉiṭi maṭavārkaḷ niṉṉaruḷ cūṭuvār
<BR>muṉpunā ṉatañcuvaṉ,
<BR>maṉṉuṭi ilaṅki yaraṇkāynta māyavaṉē,
<BR>uṉṉuṭiya cuṇṭāyam nāṉaṟivaṉ ṉiṉiyatu
<BR>koṇṭu ceyvateṉ,
<BR>eṉṉuṭiya pantum cuḻalum tantu pōku nampī.
<BR>$$6.2.1##


<H3>$$3355</H3>
__&&3355__$$06.02.2##__AAM_3463_::_LFC_3239_!!_
<P>pōkunam pī.uṉtāmari purikaṇ ṇiṇiyum
<BR>cevvāy muṟuvalum,
<BR>ākulaṅkaḷ ceyya aḻitaṟkē nōṟṟō mēyām?,
<BR>tōkimā mayilārkaḷ niṉṉaruḷ cūṭuvār
<BR>ceviyōci vitteḻa,
<BR>ākaḷ pōkaviṭṭup kuḻalūtu pōyiruntē.
<BR>$$6.2.2##


<H3>$$3356</H3>
__&&3356__$$06.02.3##__AAM_3464_::_LFC_3240_!!_
<P>pōyi runtumniṉ puḷḷuvam aṟiyāta
<BR>varkkuri nampi, niṉceyya
<BR>vāyiruṅ kaṉiyuṅ kaṇkaḷum viparīta minnāḷ,
<BR>vēyi runtaṭan tōḷiṉā rittiru
<BR>varuḷpeṟu vāryavar kol
<BR>māyiruṅ kaṭalik kaṭinta perumāṉālē?
<BR>$$6.2.3##


<H3>$$3357</H3>
__&&3357__$$06.02.4##__AAM_3465_::_LFC_3241_!!_
<P>āli ṉīḷili yēḻulaka muṇṭaṉṟu nīkiṭan
<BR>tāy,uṉ māyaṅkaḷ
<BR>mēli vāṉavaru maṟiyā riṉiyem paramē?
<BR>vēli ṉērttaṭaṅ kaṇṇiṉār viḷiyāṭu
<BR>cūḻalic cūḻavē niṉṟu
<BR>kāli mēykkaval lāy.emminī kaḻaṟēlē.
<BR>$$6.2.4##


<H3>$$3358</H3>
__&&3358__$$06.02.5##__AAM_3466_::_LFC_3242_!!_
<P>kaḻaṟēl nampī.uṉ kitavam maṇṇum viṇṇum
<BR>naṉkaṟiyum, tiṇcakkara
<BR>nīḻaṟu tolpaṭi yāy.uṉak koṉṟuṇart tuvaṉ nāṉ,
<BR>maḻaṟu tēṉmoḻi yārkaḷ niṉṉaruḷ
<BR>cūṭuvār maṉam vāṭi niṟka,em
<BR>kuḻaṟu pūviyōṭum kiḷiyōṭum kuḻakēlē.
<BR>$$6.2.5##


<H3>$$3359</H3>
__&&3359__$$06.02.6##__AAM_3467_::_LFC_3243_!!_
<P>kuḻaki yeṅkaḷ kuḻamaṇaṉ koṇṭu
<BR>kōyiṉmi ceytu kaṉmamoṉ ṟilli,
<BR>paḻaki yāmirup pōmpara mēyit tiruvaruḷkaḷ?,
<BR>aḻaki yāriv vulakumūṉ ṟukkum
<BR>tēvitami takuvār palaruḷar,
<BR>kaḻaka mēṟēl nampī.uṉakkum iḷitē kaṉmamē.
<BR>$$6.2.6##


<H3>$$3360</H3>
__&&3360__$$06.02.7##__AAM_3468_::_LFC_3244_!!_
<P>kaṉmamaṉ ṟeṅkaḷ kiyil pāvi paṟippatu
<BR>kaṭalñā muṇṭiṭṭa,
<BR>niṉmalā. neṭiyāy. uṉakkēlum piḻipiḻiyē,
<BR>vaṉmamē colli yemminī viḷiyāṭuti
<BR>atukēṭkil eṉṉimār,
<BR>taṉma pāvameṉ ṉāroru nāṉṟu taṭipiṇakkē.
<BR>$$6.2.7##


<H3>$$3361</H3>
__&&3361__$$06.02.8##__AAM_3469_::_LFC_3245_!!_
<P>piṇakki yāviyum yāvarum piḻiyāmal
<BR>pētittum pēti yātatu,ōr
<BR>kaṇakkil kīrtti veḷḷak katirñāṉa mūrttiyiṉāy,
<BR>iṇakki yemmiyen tōḻimār viḷiyāṭap
<BR>pōtumiṉ eṉa pōntōmi,
<BR>uṇakki nīvaḷit tāleṉcol lāruka vātavarē?
<BR>$$6.2.8##


<H3>$$3362</H3>
__&&3362__$$06.02.9##__AAM_3470_::_LFC_3246_!!_
<P>ukaviyāl neñcam uḷḷuruki
<BR>uṉtāmarit taṭaṅkaṇ viḻikaḷiṉ,
<BR>akavalip paṭuppāṉ aḻittāyuṉ tiruvaṭiyāl,
<BR>takavu ceytili eṅkaḷ ciṟṟilum yāmaṭu
<BR>ciṟucōṟuṅ kaṇṭu,niṉ
<BR>mukavoḷi tikaḻa muṟuval ceytu niṉṟiliyē.
<BR>$$6.2.9##


<H3>$$3363</H3>
__&&3363__$$06.02.10#__AAM_3471_::_LFC_3247_!!_
<P>niṉṟilaṅku muṭiyiṉāy. irupat tōr kāl
<BR>aracu kaḷi kaṭṭa,
