<BR>poruḷākki yuṉpoṉ ṉaṭikkīḻp pukavippāy,
<BR>maruḷē yiṉṟiyuṉṉi eṉṉeñcat tiruttum,
<BR>teruḷē taruteṉ tirunāvāy eṉtēvē.
<BR>$$9.8.8##


<H3>$$3758</H3>
__&&3758__$$09.08.9##__AAM_3866_::_LFC_3652_!!_
<P>tēvar muṉivark keṉṟumkāṇ ṭaṟkariyaṉ,
<BR>mūvar mutalvaṉ orumū vulakāḷi,
<BR>tēvaṉ virumpi yuṟiyum tirunāvāy,
<BR>yāvar aṇukap peṟuvār iṉiyantō.
<BR>$$9.8.9##


<H3>$$3759</H3>
__&&3759__$$09.08.10#__AAM_3867_::_LFC_3643_!!_
<P>antō. aṇukap peṟunāḷeṉ ṟeppōtum,
<BR>cinti kalaṅkit tirumāleṉ ṟaḻippaṉ,
<BR>kontār malarcō likaḷcuḻ tirunāvāy,
<BR>vantē yuṟikiṉṟa emmā maṇivaṇṇā.
<BR>$$9.8.10##


<H3>$$3760</H3>
__&&3760__$$09.08.11#__AAM_3868_::_LFC_3644_!!_
<P>vaṇṇam maṇimāṭa naṉṉāvāy uḷḷaṉi,
<BR>tiṇṇam matiḷteṉ kurukūrc caṭakōpaṉ,
<BR>paṇṇar tamiḻā yirattippat tumvallār,
