<H2><A NAME="TVM_09_09">3761__((TVM_09.09))</A></H2>

<H3>$$3761</H3>
__&&3761__$$09.09.1##__AAM_3869_::_LFC_3645_!!_
<P>malliki kamaḻteṉṟal īru mālō.
<BR>vaṇkuṟiñ ciyici tavaḻu mālō,
<BR>celkatir māliyum mayakku mālō.
<BR>cekkarnaṉ mēkaṅkaḷ citikku mālō,
<BR>alliyan tāmarik kaṇṇaṉ emmāṉ
<BR>āyarkaḷ ēṟari yēṟem māyōṉ,
<BR>pulliya mulikaḷum tōḷum koṇṭu
<BR>pukaliṭam aṟikilam tamiya mālō. (2)
<BR>$$9.9.1##


<H3>$$3762</H3>
__&&3762__$$09.09.2##__AAM_3870_::_LFC_3646_!!_
<P>pukaliṭam aṟikilam tamiya mālō.
<BR>pulampuṟum aṇiteṉṟal āmpa lālō,
<BR>pakalaṭu mālivaṇ cānta mālō.
<BR>pañcamam mullitaṇ vāṭi yālō,
<BR>akaliṭam paṭittiṭan tuṇṭu miḻntu
<BR>aḷanteṅkum aḷikkiṉṟa āyaṉ māyōṉ,
<BR>ikaliṭat tacurarkaḷ kūṟṟam vārāṉ
<BR>iṉiyirun teṉṉuyir kākku māṟeṉ?
<BR>$$9.9.2##


<H3>$$3763</H3>
__&&3763__$$09.09.3##__AAM_3871_::_LFC_3647_!!_
<P>iṉiyirun teṉṉuyir kākku māṟeṉ
<BR>iṇimuli namukanuṇ ṇiṭinu ṭaṅka,
<BR>tuṉiyiruṅ kalavicey tākam tōyntu
<BR>tuṟantemmi yiṭṭakal kaṇṇaṉ kaḷvaṉ,
<BR>taṉiyiḷañ ciṅkamem māyaṉ vārāṉ
<BR>tāmarik kaṇṇumcev vāyum,nīlap
<BR>paṉiyiruṅ kuḻalkaḷum nāṉku tōḷum
<BR>pāviyēṉ maṉattēniṉ ṟīru mālō.
<BR>$$9.9.3##


<H3>$$3764</H3>
__&&3764__$$09.09.4##__AAM_3872_::_LFC_3648_!!_
<P>pāviyēṉ maṉattēniṉ ṟīru mālō.
<BR>vāṭitaṇ vāṭivev vāṭi yālō,
<BR>mēvutaṇ matiyamvem matiya mālō.
<BR>meṉmalarp paḷḷivem paḷḷi yālō,
<BR>tūviyam puḷḷuṭit teyva vaṇṭu
<BR>tutinta em peṇmiyam pūvi tālō,
<BR>āviyim paramalla vakika ḷālō.
<BR>yāmuṭi neñcamum tuṇiyaṉ ṟālō.
<BR>$$9.9.4##


<H3>$$3765</H3>
__&&3765__$$09.09.5##__AAM_3873_::_LFC_3649_!!_
<P>yāmuṭi neñcamum tuṇiyaṉ ṟālō.
<BR>āpukum māliyum ākiṉ ṟālō,
<BR>yāmuṭi āyaṉtaṉ maṉamkal lālō.
<BR>avaṉuṭit tīṅkuḻa līru mālō,
<BR>yāmuṭi tuṇiyeṉṉum tōḻi mārum
<BR>emmiṉmuṉ ṉavaṉukku māyva rālō,
<BR>yāmuṭi āruyir kākku māṟeṉ?
<BR>avaṉuṭi yaruḷpe ṟumpōtu aritē.
<BR>$$9.9.5##


<H3>$$3766</H3>
__&&3766__$$09.09.6##__AAM_3874_::_LFC_3650_!!_
<P>avaṉuṭi yaruḷpe ṟumpō taritāl
<BR>avvaruḷ allaṉa aruḷum alla,
<BR>avaṉaruḷ peṟumaḷa vāvi nillātu
<BR>aṭupakal māliyum neñcum kāṇēṉ
<BR>civaṉoṭu piramaṉvaṇ tiruma ṭanti
<BR>cērtiru vākamem māvi yīrum,
<BR>evaṉiṉip pukumiṭam? evañcey kēṉō?
<BR>ārukkeṉ collukēṉ aṉṉi mīrkāḷ.
<BR>$$9.9.6##


<H3>$$3767</H3>
__&&3767__$$09.09.7##__AAM_3875_::_LFC_3651_!!_
<P>ārukkeṉ collukēṉ aṉṉi mīrkāḷ.
<BR>āruyir aḷavu aṉṟu ikkūrtaṇ vāṭi,
<BR>kārokkum mēṉinaṅ kaṇṇaṉ kaḷvam
<BR>kavarntavat taṉineñcam avaṉfka ṇaḵtē,
<BR>cīruṟṟa akiṟpuki yāḻna rampu
<BR>pañcamam taṇpacuñ cānta ṇintu,
<BR>pōruṟṟa vāṭitaṇ malli kippūp
<BR>putumaṇam mukantukoṇ ṭeṟiyu mālō.
<BR>$$9.9.7##


<H3>$$3768</H3>
__&&3768__$$09.09.8##__AAM_3876_::_LFC_3652_!!_
<P>putumaṇam mukantukoṇ ṭeṟiyu mālō.
<BR>poṅkiḷa vāṭipuṉ cekka rālō,
<BR>atumaṇan takaṉṟanaṅ kaṇṇaṉ kaḷvam
<BR>kaṇṇiṉiṟ koṭitiṉi ataṉi lumpar,
<BR>matumaṉa malliki mantak kōvi
<BR>vaṇpacuñ cāntiṉil pañca mamvittu,
<BR>atumaṇan tiṉṉaruḷ āycci yarkkē
<BR>ūtumat tīṅkuḻaṟ kēyuy yēṉnāṉ.
<BR>$$9.9.8##


<H3>$$3769</H3>
__&&3769__$$09.09.9##__AAM_3877_::_LFC_3653_!!_
<P>ūtumat tīṅkuḻaṟ kēyuy yēṉnāṉ.
<BR>atumoḻin tiṭiyiṭit tañcey kōlat,
<BR>tūtucey kaṇkaḷkoṇ ṭoṉṟu pēcit
<BR>tūmoḻi yicikaḷkoṇ ṭoṉṟu nōkki,
<BR>pētuṟum mukamceytu nontu nontu
<BR>pētineñ caṟavaṟap pāṭum pāṭṭi,
<BR>yātumoṉ ṟaṟikilam amma amma.
<BR>māliyum vantatu māyaṉ vārāṉ.
<BR>$$9.9.9##


<H3>$$3770</H3>
__&&3770__$$09.09.10#__AAM_3878_::_LFC_3654_!!_
<P>māliyum vantatu māyaṉ vārāṉ
<BR>māmaṇi pulampal lēṟa ṇinta,
<BR>kōlanaṉ ṉākukaḷ ukaḷu mālō.
<BR>koṭiyeṉa kuḻalkaḷum kuḻaṟumālō,
<BR>vāloḷi vaḷarmulli karumu kikaḷ
<BR>malliki yalampivaṇ ṭālu mālō,
<BR>vēliyum vicampilviṇ ṭalaṟu mālō.
<BR>eṉcolli yuyvaṉiṅ kavaṉi viṭṭē?
<BR>$$9.9.10##


<H3>$$3771</H3>
__&&3771__$$09.09.11#__AAM_3879_::_LFC_3655_!!_
<P>avaṉiviṭ ṭakaṉṟuyir āṟṟa killā
<BR>aṇiyiḻi āycciyar mālip pūcal,
<BR>avaṉiviṭ ṭakalvataṟ kēyi raṅki
<BR>aṇikuru kūrccaṭa kōpaṉ māṟaṉ,
<BR>avaṉiyuṇ ṭumiḻntavaṉ mēlu ritta
<BR>āyirat tuḷḷivi pattum koṇṭu,
<BR>avaṉiyuḷ alaṟṟiniṉ ṟuymmiṉ toṇṭīr.
<BR>accoṉṉa māli naṇṇit toḻutē. (2)
<BR>$$9.9.11##


